      "matters": "AMENDED ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Mar-12-2015 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled this day for OSC hearing for Name Change.<br>Dept. 514, Judge: Charles Crompton, Clerk: Yolanda Mazariegos, CSR: Mitch Lyon, #6840<br>Petitioners Do Thai and Ngo Ngo; father and mother of minor. <br>Petitioner Do Thai sworn and examined.<br>Proof of Publication on file.<br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct and sufficient, and that the petition should be granted.<br>The court grants the petition for Change of Name of minor from Bao Gia Thai to Brian Gia Thai.<br>Decree Changing Name signed in open court.",
